        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James \"Jimbo\" Mathus, Tom Maxwell, Katharine Whalen, Chris Phillips, Don Raleigh, Ken Mosher\n- Bands: The Gaslight Anthem, Squirrel Nut Zippers\n- Products: Singles Collection: 2008–2011\n- Places: New Brunswick, New Jersey, Chapel Hill, North Carolina\n\nFacts:\n- Squirrel Nut Zippers is an American swing band formed in 1993 in Chapel Hill, North Carolina.\n- James \"Jimbo\" Mathus, Tom Maxwell, Katharine Whalen, Chris Phillips, Don Raleigh, and Ken Mosher formed Squirrel Nut Zippers.\n- The Gaslight Anthem is an American rock band formed in 2006 in New Brunswick, New Jersey.\n- Singles Collection: 2008–2011 is a box set by The Gaslight Anthem.\n- Singles Collection: 2008–2011 was released on June 18, 2013.",
